          ],
          "locator": "Third Duma L45; Petrashevsky P9-P10; February L59-L60; Bloody Sunday L45-L49",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1656b/source-history-russia98/raw/prlib-third-duma.json",
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1656b/source-history-russia98/raw/prlib-dostoevsky-petrashevtsy.pdf.json",
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15fba/source-history-russia47-cycle1/raw/prlib-february-new-authorities.json",
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1605d/source-history-russia56/raw/prlib-bloody-sunday.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "explanation",
          "literal": "Третьеиюньским переворотом называют роспуск Второй Государственной думы и публикацию нового Положения о выборах 3 (16) июня 1907 года. По новому закону помещики и крупная буржуазия получили две трети общего числа выборщиков.",
          "literalSHA256": "bd3fc4eb8d771088dca35a7a78822563f41216a79d5276d1389d3188b88f1b80",
          "primaryGround": "L45 identifies the event and simultaneous action on 3 (16) June 1907; L46 states landowners and large bourgeoisie received two thirds of electors.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1656b/source-history-russia98/raw/prlib-third-duma.json"
          ],
          "locator": "L45-L46",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1656b/source-history-russia98/raw/prlib-third-duma.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note0",
          "literal": "По делу петрашевцев смертную казнь осуждённым заменили каторгой в 1849 году.",
          "literalSHA256": "753dd810ed2622d4169926850c55a527ce7107437f08627fa8d1d7ce685b967c",
          "primaryGround": "Official PBL presentation places Dostoevsky among Petrashevtsy and says the execution was replaced by four years of hard labour.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1656b/source-history-russia98/raw/prlib-dostoevsky-petrashevtsy.pdf.json"
          ],
          "locator": "P9 L204-L205; P10 L227-L229",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1656b/source-history-russia98/raw/prlib-dostoevsky-petrashevtsy.pdf.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note1",
          "literal": "Февральская революция 1917 года привела к падению монархии в России.",
          "literalSHA256": "1577895f408fe8c0a5e0cdc3c31ee74bfec422a8f62fb11e8ed7294a5d45d778",
          "primaryGround": "Official PBL page records Nicholas II abdication during February Revolution and states autocracy was overthrown during it.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15fba/source-history-russia47-cycle1/raw/prlib-february-new-authorities.json"
          ],
          "locator": "L59-L60",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15fba/source-history-russia47-cycle1/raw/prlib-february-new-authorities.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note2",
          "literal": "Кровавое воскресенье — расстрел шествия рабочих в Санкт-Петербурге 9 января 1905 года.",
          "literalSHA256": "40982088277529c65b4b2edc1f563e881dca8a3adfcb6c655f01ac766728ab14",
